<head>
<meta charset="utf-8">
<meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1">
<title>UGC 11437 — spiral galaxy, live plate</title>
<style>
  :root { --ink:#e9e2d3; --dim:#8f897b; }
  * { box-sizing:border-box; }
